          "source_quote": "postquam vero locutus est mecum, surrexit de lecto, et adprehenso pastore et virginibus abiit, dicens autem mihi, remissurum se pastorem illum et virgines in domum meam.",
          "english_quote": "Shorten sentences while preserving virgins, purity, the source’s life/exclusion warning, duties to people in need and the final departure.",
